OL,3,GNEWSAHow a once popular council leader
OL,4,Abecame a convicted fraudster
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince becoming the youngest council
OL,7,Fleader in England at just 26 years old,
OL,8,FJason Zadrozny had become synonymous
OL,9,Fwith politics in Nottinghamshire.
OL,11,FA career of nearly two decades saw him
OL,12,Fleading Ashfield District Council and
OL,13,Fserving as a Nottinghamshire county
OL,14,Fcouncillor.
OL,16,FNow the 46-year-old is in prison,
OL,17,Fhaving been jailed on Friday for 27
OL,18,Fmonths for fraud and tax evasion,
OL,19,Fcrimes the sentencing judge described
OL,20,Fas a "gross abuse of trust".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
