OL,3,GNEWSAHow a once popular council leader
OL,4,Abecame a convicted fraudster
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was in his role as a county
OL,7,Fcouncillor that Zadrozny set up a fake
OL,8,Fgroup, the Ashfield Heritage Society.
OL,9,FThe society existed only in name and he
OL,10,Fwas pocketing its funds for himself.
